  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mi>k</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><br />For a solution <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><msqrt><msup><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></msqrt></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><msqrt><msup><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn></msqrt></math><br /><br />On squaring both sides, we get,<br /><br /><math><menclose notation=\"updiagonalstrike\"><msup><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></menclose><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><menclose notation=\"updiagonalstrike\"><msup><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></menclose><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>4</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8734;</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>",
